 "name": "BTLDIR.BBQ",
 "strings": [
  "",
  "Half a century had already passed",
  "since mankind began sending",
  "its surplus population into space.",
  "The giant artificial cities",
  "around Earth became humanity's",
  "second home, where people bore",
  "children, raised them, and died.",
  "Universal Century 0079,",
  "(that's double-oh",
  " seventy-nine)",
  "Side 3, the space city farthest",
  "from Earth, styled itself the",
  "Principality of Zeon and challenged",
  "the Earth Federation government",
  "to a war of independence.",
  "The war should have ended quickly.",
  "Systems Earth had refined",
  "over millennia, versus",
  "a place people had lived in",
  "for barely half a century:",
  "from the outset, it should",
  "never have been a contest.",
  "But the course of the war",
  "utterly defied most predictions.",
  "The cause was a new Zeon weapon",
  "called the mobile suit.",
  "The mobile suit:",
  "the weapon of war that defines",
  "the Universal Century.",
  "And until that time,",
  "it had existed nowhere",
  "but in Zeon.",
  "This day in January is known",
  "as the day an Earth Federation",
  "general went from fierce to great.",
  "The solar wind was mild enough,",
  "but as it happened,",
  "scattered Minovsky particles",
  "left electronic visibility dismal,",
  "so the ships kept tight formations",
  "to make up somehow",
  "for their poor accuracy.",
  "Even so, against Zeon's",
  "mobile suits,",
  "this was no real remedy,",
  "and in those huddled formations",
  "one could almost see",
  "the end of the long warship era.",
  "This battle.",
  "Across the whole battlefield,",
  "the ships gathered",
  "numbered well over 200,",
  "and the personnel easily",
  "topped 200,000.",
  "Many of them",
  "were to die this day.",
  "Even at the cost of their lives,",
  "there was a reason",
  "they had to fight.",
  "For behind them",
  "lay the Earth.",
  "By now, there was no one",
  "but them",
  "left to defend the Earth.",
  "On this very day, Zeon",
  "was about to drop a space city,",
  "its own people's home, onto Earth.",
  "The people of space set out to win",
  "independence by merciless means.",
  "They dropped the very colony",
  "they called home onto the Earth,",
  "making it a colossal mass weapon.",
  "The outcome of this battle",
  "was tragic.",
  "In one month, half of all humanity,",
  "Earth Federation and Zeon alike,",
  "had been put to death.",
  "People came to fear",
  "what they themselves had done.",
  "Among the Federation's troops,",
  "losses and grief ran deep,",
  "and more than ever before",
  "they would repeat the same words.",
  "\"If only we had mobile suits.\"",
  "they said.",
  "Then, eight months passed..."
 ]
}
